 "body_html": "<h2>Cómo se hace</h2><p>Una <b>variable aleatoria discreta</b> toma valores sueltos; sus probabilidades suman 1. Media: μ = Σ x · P(X = x).</p><p><b>Binomial</b> B(n, p): n pruebas independientes con dos resultados; X cuenta los éxitos. P(X = k) = C<sub>n,k</sub> · p<sup>k</sup> · q<sup>n−k</sup>; μ = np; σ = √(npq).</p><p><b>Normal</b> N(μ, σ): campana simétrica. Se <b>tipifica</b> con z = (x − μ)/σ y se usa la tabla de N(0, 1). P(Z ≤ −z) = 1 − P(Z ≤ z).</p><p>Si np ≥ 5 y nq ≥ 5, la binomial se aproxima por N(np, √(npq)), con corrección por continuidad (± 0,5).</p><div class='qfig'><svg data-pf='lg' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 330 200' width='330' height='200' role='img' aria-label='campana de Gauss N(0, 1)'><g font-family='Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif'><line x1='34.0' y1='172.0' x2='34.0' y2='40.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><text x='34.0' y='192.0' font-size='15' font-weight='600' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>−3,5</text><line x1='71.4' y1='172.0' x2='71.4' y2='40.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><text x='71.4' y='192.0' font-size='15' font-weight='600' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>−2,5</text><line x1='108.9' y1='172.0' x2='108.9' y2='40.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><text x='108.9' y='192.0' font-size='15' font-weight='600' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>−1,5</text><line x1='146.3' y1='172.0' x2='146.3' y2='40.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><text x='146.3' y='192.0' font-size='15' font-weight='600' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>−0,5</text><line x1='183.7' y1='172.0' x2='183.7' y2='40.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><text x='183.7' y='192.0' font-size='15' font-weight='600' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>0,5</text><line x1='221.1' y1='172.0' x2='221.1' y2='40.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><text x='221.1' y='192.0' font-size='15' font-weight='600' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>1,5</text><line x1='258.6' y1='172.0' x2='258.6' y2='40.0' stroke='#d5dfec' st